      },
      {
        "number": 8,
        "question": "What are folders in Grafana?",
        "answer": "Folders organize dashboards into logical groups. Teams can group dashboards by application, environment, infrastructure component, or business unit. For example, folders can separate Kubernetes, AWS, database, and application dashboards."
      },
      {
        "number": 9,
        "question": "What is a Grafana variable?",
