      },
      {
        "number": 15,
        "question": "What is alert grouping in Grafana?",
        "answer": "Alert grouping combines related alert instances into a single notification instead of sending separate notifications for every alert. It reduces notification noise during large incidents, such as multiple Kubernetes pods failing together."
      },
      {
        "number": 16,
        "question": "What is a Grafana annotation?",
